WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:03.470
Don't tell me this is

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.930
Madness...

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.180
Is he going to destroy
him along with the planet?

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.100
I have to do it...

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.810
I have to!

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:33.370
Age wouldn't choose any individual...
He just dedicates his heart to us all...

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:37.620
We must save Age.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:44.760
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:51.010
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:11.080
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:18.250
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:20.130
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:25.260
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:27.090
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:32.260
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.930
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:43.770
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.780
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:52.370
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:57.620
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:01.790
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.990
There's no way to stop
a Nodos that's gone mad.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:33.910
He will keep on raging
until he destroys himself.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:37.290
We should withdraw and let
our Nodos handle the rest.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.580
We must not withdraw.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:46.550
If we don't destroy him, we will be destroyed.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:50.590
We'll use everything we've got
in this area to support our Nodos!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.250
Hold out, men! Reinforcements will come!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.250
The destruction of Jupiter is still in progress.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:13.300
I don't think a starway with such major
distortions will be fixed any time soon.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:18.180
But they're still coming.
That's the kind of ship the Argonaut is.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:21.270
Several new ships picked up on
radar. They're requesting to join us.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:25.270
Let them follow the orbit for our fleets, and we
will join them on the ship's scheduled course.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:30.190
Try to locate as many missing ships as possible
and inform them of the fleet reorganization!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.940
E-Emergency warning!
I'm picking up deadly levels of radiation

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:36.700
and an energy that far exceeds
what our ship can withstand!

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:41.330
Our A.I. system has declared it a
sign of a large star going supernova!

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:45.580
It's warning us that the explosion will reach
the critical level within a few dozen hours!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.920
No way has a star around here just
happened to reach the end of its lifespan!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.340
Identify its source and
examine the size of damage!

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.920
Judging from the data of
the past two hundred hours,

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:57.550
the source can't be
anything other than our Nodos!

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.680
According to the predicted
data for one hundred hours from now,

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.430
the solar system will be obliterated
by the exponential increase in energy!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.350
Obliterated...?

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.610
The numbers are impossible! Switch
to different measurement functions!

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.070
Th-That was the number calculated by all
the measurement functions on this ship!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:17.400
Try again! Try to calculate it again!

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:22.080
Within one hundred hours we'll be gone,
and the whole solar system with us?

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.410
There's no way we can escape from this
planetary system in such a short time!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.080
Are you sure this isn't some kind of mistake?

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.750
I recalculated, but with no
difference in the result...

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.790
Our A.I. system is still
giving the same warning.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.920
According to the legend, only
the Tribe of Gold was able to stop

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:41.600
the Tribe of Hero from fighting.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:46.140
Now this finally explains
exactly what that meant.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:52.400
Is this what's become of the hope we once had?

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.650
Contact the Argonaut at once.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.700
Gravitational disturbance
due to a warp-out detected!

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.460
Many fleets are arriving
at our current location!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:24.430
They are here...

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.930
It's unbelievable that they managed to
perform the warp navigation so precisely

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.270
from a distorted starway into
the area of such a confused fight.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:34.610
That ship holds the best
guide humankind has to offer

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:38.610
and a host of people who can answer her call.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:41.860
And here I am, making them
helplessly jump into destruction...

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.990
Even tearing myself apart
wouldn't make up for this...

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:50.790
Contact the Argonaut. I'm going to personally
send my apology to Princess Dhianeila.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.330
There's no need for that.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.670
You have done a great
job under extremely risky

00:06:55.750 --> 00:07:01.680
and chaotic circumstances,
Lieutenant General Nilval.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.430
Princess Dhianeila...

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:07.600
There are still many isolated ones out there.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:12.140
Let me tell you their locations
from what I've sensed so far.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:20.490
Through the psycholine we've received
the locations of all the missing ships!

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:24.320
Princess... We're already...

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.620
No.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.660
There's still a way.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:36.210
The Tribe of Hero once
caused massive destruction.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:43.260
At the peril of my own life,
I will calm their raging minds.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:46.760
However, we can't make it on
time while leading the fleet,

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:50.060
so only the Argonaut will go.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:53.770
Therefore, I will have to ask you to
save even more of your surviving comrades

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:57.810
and continue to fight
even more difficult battles.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:05.490
There can be no path more difficult
than the one you must proceed on.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:09.200
I, Nilval Nephew, and every
officer and soldier under me,

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:15.710
will follow you, even if we have
to smash our bodies to pieces.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:20.590
Thank you.
May the guidance of stars be with you all.

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.050
Incoming communication
signal from the Argonaut.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.260
Put it through.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.810
There you have it, Nilval.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:34.560
I know you got here first, but
we're going on ahead of you.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.850
The princess said that we
would provoke our enemies less,

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:41.070
and prevent the Earth
from becoming a battlefield.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.900
We'll focus all our energy on the warp.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:46.110
I'd like to ask you to act as
our shield until we take off

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:50.280
Surround the Argonaut with
this ship and the following fleets!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:53.120
You bastard... What's with that grin
on your face when you have no aid

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:57.460
and your greatest threat is the hero
you're supposed to be able to rely on?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.250
This is the best moment of my life.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:03.260
I'm already used to being isolated and unaided.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:07.760
Besides, there's no one on this
ship who's afraid of our Mr. Hero.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.180
Energy charge complete!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.720
Astral sign specified.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.060
Link established.

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:15.100
Well then, I'll see you on Earth, Nilval.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:20.520
Beginning the warp setting
with the acquired horoscopes.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:28.240
Terminating the normal functions.
Bringing down all the sails.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.280
Activating the dimension ripper!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:35.500
Warp in!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:34.510
Belcross has gone mad.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.930
Artemia...

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.440
Is Mehitak fighting?

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.020
Lernaea is moving...

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:47.570
Are you going to fight without
waiting to regenerate, Karkinos?

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.700
It's pathetic, Lecty.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:57.910
We don't want raging Nodos. All three of
you must eliminate the fifth one immediately.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.120
Don't let him destroy any more planets.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:05.000
If all of us fight, there's a possibility
that we'll lead each other to madness.

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:08.460
And when that happens,
the first one to go down

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:13.590
will probably be Karkinos, not the fifth one.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:14.760
What did you say?

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:18.520
In the agreement he's in,
there's a clause which means death.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:21.980
If the Tribe of Gold foresaw the future...

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.560
The Tribe of Gold only indicated
the number of the agreements.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.110
That doesn't mean they predicted the future.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:33.700
They may have known what
the Tribe of Silver would want.

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:37.450
Karkinos' Lernaea is capable of
regenerating any wounded tissue,

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.950
making it the furthest being from death.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.710
And that is exactly why they
gave him such an agreement.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:46.750
In order to subjugate him to
the Tribe of Silver for eternity.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:50.130
Then, what if all four of us go mad?

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:56.180
Don't worry. I will stop you all.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:01.220
If that's the will of the Tribe of Silver, I
have no choice but to follow the agreement.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:26.620
If all four of them go mad, I
want you to eliminate them all.

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:32.010
Don't let your emotions control
you just like those lowly tribes.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.140
Emotions? No way...

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.600
This will be dangerous if it goes on.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:30.810
As we thought, we're not capable of
stopping the madness of the Nodos.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.280
It's just the Tribe of Iron!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:42.990
Let us withdraw.

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:30.060
Each of you, now is the time to live up to
the name of the Yunos Imperial Knight Unit!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:38.570
Until the princess brings Age back to normal,

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.950
we'll do whatever it takes
to suppress this monster!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.410
What are you doing?

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:54.120
It's just the Tribe of Iron. Don't
let them interfere with Karkinos!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:02.260
Jump to the past with the power of your
Erymanthos and go crush that ship, Lecty.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:08.430
That's right... I did just that.

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:14.730
Erymanthos jumped to the past and
destroyed the ship as soon as it appeared.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:19.230
As a result, the madness of the
fifth one suddenly increased...

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:25.150
Then Karkinos died, Mehitak died and I also...

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:31.620
And at the end only the fifth one survived.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:39.920
I went back to the past again to
correct my action and saved the ship.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.300
We shouldn't destroy the ship.

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:47.760
If we did, his madness would
become even more terrifying.

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:52.310
Only the ones on that ship can stop him.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:18.920
Age!

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:24.260
Why?

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:39.600
You knew about it...

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:50.700
That's why... all by yourself...

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:03.880
I'm sorry... I'm sorry, Age...

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:13.850
I'm sorry for letting you be alone... I'm sorry
for always expecting your Belcross to fight...

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:18.390
When that's not what you two desire at all!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.400
I'm sorry!

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.040
Age...

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:02.940
Age!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:31.550
Mehitak was defeated. If he's
still alive, bring him back with you.

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.590
We'll get him without driving
him into madness next time.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.680
Mehitak...

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.810
It disappeared?

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.530
Did Mehitak stop his madness?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.910
I'm going back to Rom Ror's planet with you.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:59.290
How about Mehitak?

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:02.910
Mehitak was waiting for a long time.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.840
He was waiting for the being that
would defeat him and his Artemia.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:12.550
So he shouldn't have to fight anymore.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:20.930
Let's go. There still are
agreements that we must fulfill.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:30.710
I didn't realize until I met you

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:36.880
That I was this strong.

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:40.220
I have found something
that I want to protect

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:48.890
And you're the one
who's shown me what it is

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:56.650
Just being with you makes
even my ordinary days shine brightly

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:01.240
Your voice and smile,
l want to protect them forever

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:15.340
It was dark, but I saw a light.

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:19.970
And the light was you.

00:22:22.260 --> 00:22:32.100
Age!

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:38.320
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:41.860
That I love you

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:47.450
On nights we can't see each
other because we're far apart

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:53.170
I look at the stars in the sky

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:59.470
l want to believe passionately in
the feelings that I have for you

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:08.020
and continue to protect them

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:17.190
For me, it's you who are the light.

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:18.900
Age...

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:40.590
Further resolve is required in
order to carve his own destiny.

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:45.470
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 16: "Beyond Several Rules."
